Assistance of financial experts should be taken:
a) Conversion or transfer of crime proceeds for the purpose of concealing their illicit origin;
b) Concealment or disguise of crime proceeds;
c) Acquisition, possession or use of crime proceeds;
d) Contributing indirectly to the commission of the offences outlined above,
including participation in and conspiring or attempting to commit the offences in question.
